# Reflection Beam-1.0-501B-A23B NVFP4, the a2 configuration (two Stations, TP2, DFlash2 block 8; same image, flags and launcher as
# e-a2-two-stations.log), quality pass. Run 2026-10-16 21:57-22:46 PT, boot A (0 retries).
# GSM8K-200: first 200 rows of the GSM8K test set (not the full 1,319), reasoning_effort low (Beam template budget 32), temperature 0,
# max_tokens 6000, C16. Tools: our in-house tests, OpenAI tools format with the server's beam tool parser: 3 smoke cases + 12 extended
# cases (selection, parallel calls, no-tool, enum, typed number, date, tool-result follow-up). Long context: our in-house needle test,
# public CNN/DailyMail text cut to ~64K and ~126.6K prompt tokens with synthetic 6-digit codes at fixed depths (4 single needles +
# 2 two-hop chains per length), reasoning_effort low, temperature 0. Soak: 20 minutes at C16, non-streaming, a seeded mix of seven
# request classes (GSM8K effort high and low, random ids, long synthetic text, short chat, GSM8K at temperature 0.6, a shared-prefix
# class); short chat and the 0.6 GSM8K class sample at temperature 0.6, the rest are greedy; 600 s per-request timeout.
# Not the a2 throughput rows: those are in e-a2-two-stations.log.
# Excerpt: lines selected verbatim from the raw files named below; host names, GPU UUIDs, rail IPs and private paths replaced with
# <placeholders>. Times are Pacific (PT).
